# Regression test for #8921: pipelining must not break console.
# Before the fix, subproject/console failed with a FileSystemException on
# Windows (early.jar lock), and root console would interrupt REPL evaluation
# ("Canceling execution..." / InterruptedException) on all platforms.
# We cannot run console non-interactively (the REPL blocks on stdin), so
# we assert the option list directly via a custom task instead.

> compile
> subproject/checkConsoleScalacOptions
> checkConsoleScalacOptions
